  "captions": [
    {
      "at": 8.2,
      "until": 11.6,
      "text": "Your question just left for a building full of machines.",
      "hi": "a building full of machines."
    },
    {
      "at": 12.6,
      "until": 17.2,
      "text": "A data center. Rows of racks, as far as you can see.",
      "hi": "A data center."
    },
    {
      "at": 17.6,
      "until": 22.8,
      "text": "The biggest ones hold over 100,000 GPUs.",
      "hi": "100,000 GPUs.",
      "say": "The biggest ones hold over a hundred thousand GPUs."
    },
    {
      "at": 23.2,
      "until": 29.4,
      "text": "And draw as much power as a small city.",
      "hi": "a small city."
    },
    {
      "at": 30.6,
      "until": 34.8,
      "text": "One rack: 72 GPUs.",
      "hi": "72 GPUs.",
      "say": "One rack: seventy-two GPUs."
    },
    {
      "at": 35.2,
      "until": 40.6,
      "text": "Wired together at the back, so the whole rack acts like one giant GPU.",
      "hi": "one giant GPU."
    },
    {
      "at": 41.0,
      "until": 47.4,
      "text": "It pulls about 120 kW. Air can't cool that, so water runs through every tray.",
      "hi": "water runs through every tray.",
      "say": "It pulls about a hundred and twenty kilowatts. Air can't cool that, so water runs through every tray."
    },
    {
      "at": 48.6,
      "until": 52.8,
      "text": "One tray: 2 CPUs and 4 GPUs.",
      "hi": "4 GPUs.",
      "say": "One tray: two CPUs and four GPUs."
    },
    {
      "at": 53.2,
      "until": 57.4,
      "text": "Coolant flows over every chip to carry the heat away.",
      "hi": "carry the heat away."
    },
    {
      "at": 57.8,
      "until": 61.6,
      "text": "Lift the cold plate, and there it is.",
      "hi": "there it is."
    },
    {
      "at": 62.6,
      "until": 67.2,
      "text": "Two slabs of silicon, fused into one chip.",
      "hi": "one chip."
    },
    {
      "at": 67.6,
      "until": 72.2,
      "text": "208 billion transistors.",
      "hi": "208 billion",
      "say": "Two hundred and eight billion transistors."
    },
    {
      "at": 72.6,
      "until": 77.0,
      "text": "Around them: 8 towers of stacked memory, called HBM.",
      "hi": "stacked memory",
      "say": "Around them: eight towers of stacked memory, called H B M."
    },
    {
      "at": 77.4,
      "until": 81.6,
      "text": "192 GB. That's where the AI model lives.",
      "hi": "where the AI model lives.",
      "say": "A hundred and ninety-two gigabytes. That's where the AI model lives."
    },
    {
      "at": 82.6,
      "until": 87.6,
      "text": "An AI model is just numbers. Billions of them, called weights.",
      "hi": "just numbers."
    },
    {
      "at": 88.0,
      "until": 93.2,
      "text": "To write each word, the chip streams those weights out of memory.",
      "hi": "each word"
    },
    {
      "at": 93.6,
      "until": 99.6,
      "text": "8 terabytes per second. And that's still often the bottleneck.",
      "hi": "still often the bottleneck.",
      "say": "Eight terabytes per second. And that's still often the bottleneck."
    },
    {
      "at": 100.6,
      "until": 105.0,
      "text": "Inside each die: a grid of identical cores.",
      "hi": "identical cores."
    },
    {
      "at": 105.4,
      "until": 110.0,
      "text": "Each one juggles thousands of threads at once.",
      "hi": "thousands of threads"
    },
    {
      "at": 110.4,
      "until": 115.6,
      "text": "And each holds tensor cores, built for one single job.",
      "hi": "one single job."
    },
    {
      "at": 116.6,
      "until": 122.4,
      "text": "Multiply two grids of numbers. Add up the results.",
      "hi": "Add up the results."
    },
    {
      "at": 122.8,
      "until": 128.0,
      "text": "That's it. That's what AI is, underneath.",
      "hi": "what AI is, underneath."
    },
    {
      "at": 128.4,
      "until": 133.6,
      "text": "This chip does it quadrillions of times a second.",
      "hi": "quadrillions"
    },
    {
      "at": 134.6,
      "until": 138.2,
      "text": "At the very bottom: switches.",
      "hi": "switches."
    },
    {
      "at": 138.6,
      "until": 142.0,
      "text": "Voltage on the gate lets current through. Or it doesn't.",
      "hi": "Or it doesn't."
    },
    {
      "at": 142.4,
      "until": 145.7,
      "text": "208 billion of them, flipping billions of times a second.",
      "hi": "billions of times a second.",
      "say": "Two hundred and eight billion of them, flipping billions of times a second."
